You own this repository. Commit on `main` and push to `origin main`.

Do not open a pull request, do not create a branch, and do not ask the user to check or merge your work.

Run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` and get a pass before the push. One settled behavior per push. Anything not in `SETTLED.md` is not implemented.

Write notes into the repo in the same push that produces them. Repeating bytes go in `FINDINGS.md`. Product and engine notes go in `RESEARCH.md`, with the source named.
